[00:12.500]I'm sitting here in the boring room
{"我坐在这无聊的房间里"}
[00:16.000]It's just another rainy Sunday afternoon
{"这不过是又一个阴雨的周日下午"}
[00:19.000]I'm wasting my time I got nothing to do
{"我在虚度光阴 无事可做"}
[00:22.500]I'm hanging around I'm waiting for you
{"我四处徘徊 等待着你"}
[00:25.500]But nothing ever happens and I wonder
{"但什么都没发生 我不禁疑惑"}
[00:30.000]
[00:33.000]I'm driving around in my car
{"我开着车四处兜风"}
[00:36.000]I'm driving too fast I'm driving too far
{"开得太快 开得太远"}
[00:39.500]I'd like to change my point of view
{"我想要换个视角"}
[00:42.500]I feel so lonely I'm waiting for you
{"如此孤独 我仍在等你"}
[00:45.500]But nothing ever happens, and I wonder
{"但什么都没发生 我不禁疑惑"}
[00:50.000]
[00:53.000]I wonder how, I wonder why
{"我想知道如何 我想知道为何"}
[00:56.000]Yesterday you told me about the blue blue sky
{"昨天你还向我描述那片蓝蓝的天"}
[00:59.000]And all that I can see
{"而此刻我眼前所见"}
[01:02.000]is just  a  yellow lemon tree
{"唯有一棵黄色柠檬树"}
[01:04.000]
[01:06.500]I'm turning my head up and down
{"我上下摆动着头"}
[01:09.500]I'm turning turning turning
{"转啊转 转啊转"}
[01:11.300]turning turning around
{"不停地转着圈"}
[01:12.500]And all that I can see
{"而此刻我眼前所见"}
[01:15.500]is just a (another) lemon tree
{"唯有一棵（另一棵）柠檬树"}
[01:17.500]
[01:19.000]sing:Da Da Da Da Da Di Da Da
[01:25.000]Da Da Da Da Di Da Da
[01:28.500]Da Di Di Da
[01:30.000]
[01:33.000]I'm sitting here I miss the power
{"我坐在这里 怀念力量的感觉"}
[01:36.500]I'd like to go out taking a shower
{"真想冲个澡出门走走"}
[01:40.000]But there's a heavy cloud inside my head
{"但脑海中阴云密布"}
[01:43.000]I feel so tired put myself into bed
{"疲惫不堪 我把自己扔上床"}
[01:46.000]Well nothing ever happens and I wonder
{"唉 什么都没发生 我不禁疑惑"}
[01:50.000]
[01:54.000]Isolation is not good for me
{"孤独对我没有益处"}
[02:00.500]Isolation I don't want to sit on a lemon tree
{"孤独 我可不想坐在柠檬树上"}
[02:06.500]I'm stepping around in a desert of joy
{"我在欢乐的荒漠中徘徊"}
[02:10.000]Baby any how I'll get another toy
{"宝贝 无论如何我会找到新欢"}
[02:13.000]And everything will happen and you'll wonder
{"一切终将发生而你充满疑惑"}
[02:17.000]
[02:20.000]I wonder how I wonder why
